{
  "_readme": "Census construction spending (value put in place) by market, via FRED. saar = seasonally adjusted annual rate ($ millions); nsa = actual monthly dollars, used for year-to-date sums. building = true markets are summed into Nonresidential Buildings and deflated by the deflator series (a PPI selling-price index for new nonresidential buildings).",
  "historyStart": "2017-01-01",
  "deflator": "WPU801",
